<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] previously led a nomadic lifestyle. Constantly moving acquired useful skills for life in temporary camps. -->
  <OE_Drifter.description>[PAWN_nameDef]以前过着游牧生活。不断迁徙获得了在临时营地生活的有用技能。</OE_Drifter.description>
  <!-- EN: obsidia drifter -->
  <OE_Drifter.title>黑曜石流浪者</OE_Drifter.title>
  <!-- EN: drifter -->
  <OE_Drifter.titleShort>流浪者</OE_Drifter.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] was cast out from an Obsidia enclave under unknown charges-real or fabricated. Survived in the wastes by any means necessary, becoming hard, quiet, and resourceful. -->
  <OE_Exile.description>[PAWN_nameDef]因未知指控（真实或捏造）被黑曜石飞地驱逐。通过任何必要手段在荒野中生存，变得坚强、沉默和足智多谋。</OE_Exile.description>
  <!-- EN: obsidia exile -->
  <OE_Exile.title>黑曜石流放者</OE_Exile.title>
  <!-- EN: exile -->
  <OE_Exile.titleShort>流放者</OE_Exile.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] roamed ancient battlefields and collapsed vaults, extracting anything of value. Knows how to strip a ruin clean—but often speaks in fragments and sparks. -->
  <OE_Salvager.description>[PAWN_nameDef]在古战场和倒塌的地下墓穴中游荡，提取任何有价值的东西。知道如何彻底清理废墟——但经常说话支离破碎且闪烁其词。</OE_Salvager.description>
  <!-- EN: obsidia salvager -->
  <OE_Salvager.title>黑曜石 salvager</OE_Salvager.title>
  <!-- EN: salvager -->
  <OE_Salvager.titleShort>Salvager</OE_Salvager.titleShort>
  
  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] served as a long-range scout for a drifting clan, trained to survive alone and report back unseen. Fast, quiet, and observant—but not one for deep study. -->
  <OE_Scout.description>[PAWN_nameDef]担任流浪部落的远程侦察员，受训独自生存并秘密报告。快速、安静且观察敏锐——但不适合深入研究。</OE_Scout.description>
  <!-- EN: obsidia scout -->
  <OE_Scout.title>黑曜石侦察员</OE_Scout.title>
  <!-- EN: scout -->
  <OE_Scout.titleShort>侦察员</OE_Scout.titleShort>
  
</LanguageData>